## Interface: 16001
## Title: |cffffc61aVolt|rUI
## Notes: A flat, dark look for the game's UI. Player and target frames, its own party and raid frames with a heal mode, click-casting, HoT timers and dispel windows, nameplates, castbar, WeakAuras-style timers for your class's cooldowns, buffs, procs, debuffs and totems, bar textures, twenty bundled fonts with a font of its own for any text, bags, loot window, tooltips, junk selling, square minimap, a world map with zone levels and coordinates, a skin for Questie, and one settings window with search, copying between frames, a grid with pixel nudges, export and import, and an error catcher.
